            "frequency": 859262500,
            "#gains": "R828D steps are discrete (…25.4, 28.0, 29.7, 32.8, 33.8, 36.4, 38.6…) and multi_rx rounds to an int, so 30 lands on 29.7. Was 39 (i.e. 38.6), near max: on 800 MHz that overloads into IMD, which sounds like a bad decode. Sweep this against the symbol_quality chip in Tuning & Diagnostics.",
