            "gain_mode": false,
            "offset": 0,
            "#ppm": "Still unmeasured. Read 'freq error' off the UI once the CC is locked and divide by 859.2625 to get ppm.",
            "ppm": 0.0,
            "#rate": "2400000 is in multi_rx's approved RTL speeds list and divides exactly by if_rate 24000 (decim 100), so the arbitrary resampler in p25_demodulator_dev is skipped entirely. 1000000 gave decim 41 -> 24390 -> arb resample to 24000. Also widens the window to 2.04 MHz, so fewer voice grants force a device retune.",
